      <pubDate>Wed, 16 Feb 2022 11:19:07 -0600</pubDate>
      <title>Full Time Event Specialist Positions</title>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">51046517</guid>
      <link>https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/OHCCC/bulletins/30ae875</link>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<p>The Recreation and Parks Department&rsquo;s Office of Special Events currently has two available positions. One in marketing and one in production.</p>
<p>The <strong>marketing position</strong> will help to support development, planning, production and evaluation of diverse programs and events produced by the Office of Special Events and oversee marketing and communications campaigns for events; support the public relations functions as media liaison; write and edit web content, marketing materials and press releases; coordinate printed, graphic, audio, and electronic and social media as well as design and maintain basic web page content and layout.</p>
<p>The preferred marketing candidate will have experience developing and executing marketing and communications plans for concerts, events and festivals.</p>
<p>The <strong>production position</strong> will help to support development, planning, production and evaluation of diverse programs and events produced by the Office of Special Events and oversee technical and stage production requirements for each event; review artist technical riders and advance logistics; coordinate sound, lighting and backline production; secure contract stage and support staff; serve as stage manager during events; provide technical assistance and coordinate equipment usage for rental requests; &nbsp;and oversee maintenance and inventory of audio/visual, sound, lighting and staging equipment.</p>
<p>The preferred production candidate will have experience overseeing the technical and stage production requirements of outdoor concerts, events and festivals and have familiarity with the setup and operation of Stage Line mobile stages.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Please share this link with anyone who might be interested in applying:</p>
<p><a href="https://www.governmentjobs.com/careers/columbusoh/jobs/3420437/event-coordination-specialist-exam?page=2&pagetype=jobOpportunitiesJobs&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="Event Coordination Specialist" rel="noopener">Event Coordination Specialist</a></p>
<p>Applications must be submitted by 2/28/2022.</p>]]>
      </description>
    </item>
